    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to the workshop of the late clockwork engineer, Archibald Vance. You find yourself trapped inside his master control room, a chaotic symphony of hissing pipes, rotating gears, and polished brass mechanisms. Vance was intensely paranoid, securing the exit behind a complex network of steam-powered calculation engines and mechanical ciphers. The air is thick with the smell of oil and ozone. To escape, you must trace the flow of energy through his strange contraptions, powering each device in the correct sequence to activate the final lock mechanism before the workshop's boiler pressure reaches a catastrophic critical state.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
  },
